Inkling 2 DSpark drafter support, from ggml-org/llama.cpp#32218.

Taken from the pull request head 1989f96d8fda12b216dc5bd5c948bb7d50ebc92c,
diffed against its merge base 29b52d398b294509746ec0a3f28948a3107c0213 and
limited to common/, include/ and src/. Without it, the DSpark drafter of
Inkling 2 (`spec_type: draft-dspark`) does not load: markov_w1 has the
padded vocabulary size, and the head uses tensors that master lacks.
Use the default greedy draft sampling: with `spec_draft_sampling:
probabilistic` this version made no progress in a CPU test.

Delete this file when LLAMA_VERSION reaches a commit that contains
ggml-org/llama.cpp#32218. The patch is then already applied, prepare.sh
stops at it, and the build fails until the file is removed.

